OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome clear
OL,6,Fspells to start on Wednesday night,
OL,7,Fbut soon becoming mostly cloudy,
OL,8,Fthough remaining dry. Winds light at
OL,9,Ffirst but soon becoming breezy.
OL,10,FGenerally mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FMostly cloudy and rather
OL,13,Fwarm Thursday, with the chance of a
OL,14,Ffew sunny spells developing later in
OL,15,Fthe afternoon. Remaining dry
OL,16,Fthroughout, although breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
