OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain at
OL,6,Ffirst on Friday will soon clear
OL,7,Fsoutheastwards, leaving sunny spells
OL,8,Fand showers through the rest of the
OL,9,Fperiod. Showers may become locally
OL,10,Fheavy on Sunday. Cooler and breezy.
